<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tech Synergy | Home</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #020617;
            --accent-cyan: #22d3ee;
            --card-glass: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7);
            --text-white: #f8fafc;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-white);
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Live Tech Background Effect */
        .bg-video {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            z-index: -1;
            object-fit: cover;
            opacity: 0.4; /* Adjusted for readability */
            filter: hue-rotate(180deg); /* Optional: tweaks color to match tech blue */
        }

        header {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 1rem 0;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .container { width: 85%; max-width: 1200px; margin: auto; }
        nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .logo { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-white); }
        .logo span { color: var(--accent-cyan); }
        .nav-links { display: flex; list-style: none; gap: 25px; }
        .nav-links a { color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; transition: 0.3s; }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent-cyan); }

        .hero {
            padding: 120px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; margin-bottom: 20px; text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.3); }
        .hero p { color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 1.2rem; max-width: 700px; margin: auto; }

        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            padding: 80px 0;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--card-glass);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            transition: 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.1);
        }

        .card i { font-size: 2.5rem; color: var(--accent-cyan); margin-bottom: 20px; }

        /* Updated Footer with Credentials */
        footer {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
            padding: 50px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer-info { margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .student-name { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: bold; color: var(--text-white); letter-spacing: 1px; }
        .reg-no { font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; color: var(--accent-cyan); margin-top: 5px; }
        .project-tag { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b; margin-top: 15px; text-transform: uppercase; }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Background Video: Dynamic Abstract Tech -->
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=2072" class="bg-video" alt="Tech Background">

    <header>
        <nav class="container">
            <div class="logo"><i class="fas fa-satellite-dish"></i> TECH<span>SYNERGY</span></div>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#">HOME</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">ARTICLES</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">PROJECTS</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">ABOUT</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">CONTACT</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>The Future of Digital Systems</h1>
            <p>Advancing the integration of information technology within modern economic frameworks.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <main class="container">
        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="card">
                <i class="fas fa-network-wired"></i>
                <h3>Scalable Systems</h3>
                <p>Designing infrastructure capable of handling the demands of global e-business environments.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <i class="fas fa-brain"></i>
                <h3>Smart Computation</h3>
                <p>Leveraging advanced logic and Python-driven analysis to solve real-world technical problems.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <i class="fas fa-fingerprint"></i>
                <h3>Cyber Security</h3>
                <p>Prioritizing data integrity and user privacy in every line of code we deploy.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="footer-info">
                <div class="student-name">MIHIGO VALLERIAN IVAN</div>
                <div class="reg-no">Reg No: 23/U/MSD/0874/P</div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-tag">E-Business Project &copy; 2026</div>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
